data: {"id": "b023481121a94806-thinking-parallel_evidence-553", "run_id": "b023481121a94806", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将按照指令执行。\n\n**首轮验证计划：**\n1.  **kubectl_get_yaml**: 获取 Pod YAML，检查 command/args/image/resources 配置。\n2.  **kubectl_events**: 获取 Pod Events，检查 BackOff、Killing 和探针失败记录。\n3.  **kubectl_previous_logs**: 获取上一次崩溃容器的日志，寻找崩溃原文。\n4.  **execute_pod_promql**: 获取 Pod 真实生命周期、退出原因、等待原因和重启指标。\n5.  **query_pod_logs**: 获取 ES 侧最近日志，确认业务错误原文。\n6.  **query_pod_tracing**: 获取 DeepFlow/Tempo 流量，确认请求与错误链路。\n7.  **query_pod_topology**: 获取 Pod 拓扑关系。\n\n开始执行工具调用。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788792075775, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

