 退出。\n\n这一结论由以下事实链严密支撑：\n1.  **直接行为证据**：日志聚合事实显示 `pattern=CONFIG_MISSING`，且 Tracing 记录中 `observed_mode` 明确标识为 `config_missing_exit`。\n2.  **系统异常证据**：K8s 状态确认容器反复终止（`exit_code=78`）并进入 `CrashLoopBackOff`，且 `resource` 维度无 OOM 迹象。\n\n未确认项为：具体是哪个 ConfigMap Key 缺失，或环境变量名是否与 Pod YAML 中的挂载配置存在拼写/映射错误（输入中 Pod YAML 细节被隐去，无法直接比对键名）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 65.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 65.0s (Evidence 55.4s, RCA 9.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 93.864, "metrics": {"run_id": "b023481121a94806", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 93.85880446434021, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "wei